{"concept":"bite","groups":[{"id":"morsels-and-bites","name":{"ru":"Куски, лакомства и укусы","en":"Morsels, delicacies and bites"},"count":6},{"id":"other-bites","name":{"ru":"Яд, совесть, наживка и прочие укусы","en":"Venom, conscience, bait and other bites"},"count":19},{"id":"release-bite","name":{"ru":"Удушье и освобождающий укус","en":"Suffocation and the releasing bite"},"count":6}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9d7b648f93ade9b0147f2895aa91bba5","tos.text-unit.sid-9d7b648f93ade9b0147f2895aa91bba5"]},"form":"Bissen","speaker":"tightrope-walker","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"morsels-and-bites","neighbours":["dance","tightrope-walker"],"line":{"ru":"Плясун вспоминает обучение через побои и скудную пищу.","en":"The tightrope walker recalls training through blows and scant food."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-790638ad3d3dc3dfb8b945d0108e3b47","tos.text-unit.sid-790638ad3d3dc3dfb8b945d0108e3b47"]},"form":"Bissen","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"morsels-and-bites","neighbours":["will","becoming","laughter","gravediggers"],"line":{"ru":"Могильщики высмеивают заботу о мёртвом как кражу дьявольской пищи.","en":"The gravediggers mock care for the dead as stealing the devil’s morsel."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-94b1fe7ed5c9fd941d159b5c42aa564e","tos.text-unit.sid-94b1fe7ed5c9fd941d159b5c42aa564e"]},"form":"beissen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["courage","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Смертная усталость ждёт случайного конца со стиснутыми зубами.","en":"Deathly weariness waits with clenched teeth for a chance ending."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b47f8ebeddbf86c3f63e455720afa2af","tos.text-unit.sid-b47f8ebeddbf86c3f63e455720afa2af"]},"form":"beisst","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["body-self","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Государство кусает украденными зубами.","en":"The state bites with stolen teeth."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3bcd255d895e8482b89dc3e5ebdc9444","tos.text-unit.sid-3bcd255d895e8482b89dc3e5ebdc9444"]},"form":"ausbeissen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Твёрдая оболочка хранит тонкость сострадания другу.","en":"A hard shell preserves pity for a friend’s delicacy."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7d5819693a40f5731fbc1f75435ce157","tos.text-unit.sid-7d5819693a40f5731fbc1f75435ce157"]},"form":"biss","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["will","bestowing-virtue","zarathustra","adder"],"line":{"ru":"Змея будит Заратустру укусом; он благодарит её, а она лижет его рану.","en":"A snake wakes Zarathustra with a bite; he thanks it, and it licks his wound."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5564b186c6f799825898969601cddc75","tos.text-unit.sid-5564b186c6f799825898969601cddc75"]},"form":"Gewissensbisse","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Укоры совести учат кусать других.","en":"Remorse teaches biting."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4c332710d249bbe842a5cb849c9744f9","tos.text-unit.sid-4c332710d249bbe842a5cb849c9744f9"]},"form":"beissen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["will","zarathustra","passive-virtuous"],"line":{"ru":"Добродетель покорности хвалится безвредностью и готовыми мнениями.","en":"The virtue of conformity boasts harmlessness and received opinions."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4df2043af452d730da92e94e93b7c89a","tos.text-unit.sid-4df2043af452d730da92e94e93b7c89a"]},"form":"Bissen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"morsels-and-bites","neighbours":["identity","necessity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Жизненная нужда во вражде становится тяжёлым куском знания.","en":"Life’s need for hostility becomes a hard morsel of knowledge."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8af5e888e7b9c637d4632243e568e22a","tos.text-unit.sid-8af5e888e7b9c637d4632243e568e22a"]},"form":"beissest","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["revenge","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Яд тарантула заставляет душу кружиться от мщения.","en":"The tarantula’s poison makes the soul spin with revenge."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f86fafa2b405a6af91975efcd8c23f22","tos.text-unit.sid-f86fafa2b405a6af91975efcd8c23f22"]},"form":"biss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Укус тарантула вовлекает учителя в опасность мести.","en":"The tarantula’s bite draws the teacher into revenge’s danger."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c1b2dba9d1dd9f79382a1ced1fe1e2e3","tos.text-unit.sid-c1b2dba9d1dd9f79382a1ced1fe1e2e3"]},"form":"beissen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"life","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Мудрость описана изменчивой, упрямой и кусающей губы.","en":"Wisdom is described as changeable, wilful and biting her lips."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-731a9e34e7c14198ab956f27436becc4","tos.text-unit.sid-731a9e34e7c14198ab956f27436becc4"]},"form":"biss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sailors","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"release-bite","neighbours":["nausea","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"На лице пастуха видны отвращение и смертельный ужас; змея впилась в его глотку.","en":"The shepherd’s disgust appears in his face and the fastened snake."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f2eedab19687488999cbf7581dc2b74e","tos.text-unit.sid-f2eedab19687488999cbf7581dc2b74e"]},"form":"Beiss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"shepherd","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"release-bite","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Не сумев вырвать змею, Заратустра кричит: «Откуси!»","en":"Unable to pull out the snake, Zarathustra cries: “Bite off!”"}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7a283fb2da9d76328d331e581c823e09","tos.text-unit.sid-7a283fb2da9d76328d331e581c823e09"]},"form":"Beiss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"shepherd","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"release-bite","neighbours":["nausea","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Ужас, ненависть, отвращение и жалость сливаются в один крик.","en":"Horror, hatred, disgust and pity join in one cry."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e66b64066560dd30bcae8af64e9f5193","tos.text-unit.sid-e66b64066560dd30bcae8af64e9f5193"]},"form":"biss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sailors","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"release-bite","neighbours":["zarathustra","shepherd"],"line":{"ru":"Пастух сам откусывает голову змеи и вскакивает.","en":"The shepherd bites off the snake’s head himself and leaps up."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6b7990db6643023c5fc2b6d9d80833db","tos.text-unit.sid-6b7990db6643023c5fc2b6d9d80833db"]},"form":"biss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["attention","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Бездна Заратустры зашевелилась, и его мысль укусила его.","en":"Zarathustra’s abyss stirred, and his thought bit him."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2ab28e36d239473986dac7805cd84093","tos.text-unit.sid-2ab28e36d239473986dac7805cd84093"]},"form":"beissen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["necessity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Малые добродетели вызывают вопрос о необходимости малых людей.","en":"Small virtues raise the question of small people’s necessity."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-dc10371097d72bd6fc060b528ecd6341","tos.text-unit.sid-dc10371097d72bd6fc060b528ecd6341"]},"form":"beissen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель изображает себя петухом на чужом дворе.","en":"The teacher pictures himself as a cock in a strange yard."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c86652389ac127f0c680fe9b45dd1df5","tos.text-unit.sid-c86652389ac127f0c680fe9b45dd1df5"]},"form":"Leckerbissen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"morsels-and-bites","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Невзрачная скорлупа может скрывать доброту и силу, которые никто не угадает.","en":"A rough shell hides good power from discerning taste."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c1a61ec1014026941c54254a0978115d","tos.text-unit.sid-c1a61ec1014026941c54254a0978115d"]},"form":"biss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"animals","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"release-bite","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель сам откусывает голову удушающему чудовищу.","en":"The teacher himself bites off the suffocating monster’s head."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4f156d0bad165d016f941204caf55153","tos.text-unit.sid-4f156d0bad165d016f941204caf55153"]},"form":"Beissen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"animals","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"release-bite","neighbours":["redemption","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Собственное избавление оставляет учителя утомлённым и больным.","en":"His own redemption leaves the teacher weary and ill."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b861a9a73a20687c1029022fb0a01586","tos.text-unit.sid-b861a9a73a20687c1029022fb0a01586"]},"form":"anbeissend","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Скрытые крючки должны поднять людей в высоту.","en":"Hidden hooks are to draw people up to the height."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2b0625ea010348d0000ef2868ba949e7","tos.text-unit.sid-2b0625ea010348d0000ef2868ba949e7"]},"form":"Beisse","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Удочка должна впиться в живот чёрной скорби.","en":"The fishing rod is to bite into the belly of black sorrow."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.04","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7f9fc1e0b9e52bff0742c236a8933bac","tos.text-unit.sid-7f9fc1e0b9e52bff0742c236a8933bac"]},"form":"Biss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"conscientious","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Кровь на руке вызывает вопрос об укусе зверя.","en":"Blood on the arm prompts a question about an animal’s bite."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.04","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e64348f97758014f12654828a26cdbb5","tos.text-unit.sid-e64348f97758014f12654828a26cdbb5"]},"form":"biss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"conscientious","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Совестливый изображает встречу двойной раной от зверя и человека.","en":"The conscientious one pictures the encounter as a double wound from animal and human."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.04","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5ad8f7f44b5182840708589b79a121d8","tos.text-unit.sid-5ad8f7f44b5182840708589b79a121d8"]},"form":"angebissen","speaker":"conscientious","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"morsels-and-bites","neighbours":["identity","conscientious"],"line":{"ru":"Научное внимание к пиявке принимает укус самого учителя.","en":"Scientific attention to the leech receives the teacher’s own bite."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.04","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-dc13b681db2e5f3c2c795b4f9cc755d5","tos.text-unit.sid-dc13b681db2e5f3c2c795b4f9cc755d5"]},"form":"eingebissen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"conscientious","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"morsels-and-bites","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Впившиеся пиявки делают цену исследования видимой.","en":"The fastened leeches make inquiry’s price visible."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-560c8e1bc5e590cf6443e36f4cc8d830","tos.text-unit.sid-560c8e1bc5e590cf6443e36f4cc8d830"]},"form":"Beisszähnen","speaker":"shadow","addressee":"daughters","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["courage","will","lion","affirmation","identity","memory","difference","agency","dance","loneliness","shadow"],"line":{"ru":"Тень поёт о льве и обезьяне — ревуне морали, называя себя европейцем.","en":"The shadow sings of the lion and the ape, a moral howler, calling himself a European."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b91a8af95a255d1a34c86acec29138d0","tos.text-unit.sid-b91a8af95a255d1a34c86acec29138d0"]},"form":"beissen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["identity","attention","laughter","spirit-of-gravity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Приманка срабатывает: гости учатся смеяться над собой.","en":"The bait works: the guests learn to laugh at themselves."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4c6965df3cda4fac17ddff4d6b911a29","tos.text-unit.sid-4c6965df3cda4fac17ddff4d6b911a29"]},"form":"beisst","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"other-bites","neighbours":["will","ring","joy-lust","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Радость кусает себя и несёт волю кольца.","en":"Joy bites itself and bears the ring’s will."}}]}
